{"envelope": "{\"format\":\"gravitas.artifact\",\"formatVersion\":1,\"id\":\"compute:posterior-sampling:cdec1936f69a2cdb\",\"made\":{\"app\":\"gravitas\"},\"provenance\":{\"citations\":[\"TESS Light Curves - All Sectors, STScI/MAST\",\"Ricker et al. 2015, JATIS 1, 014003 (TESS)\",\"Jenkins et al. 2016, Proc. SPIE 9913, 99133E (SPOC)\"],\"credit\":\"TESS, sector 56 (NASA; SPOC light curve from MAST)\",\"license\":{\"statement\":\"NASA mission data, released through MAST without restriction on reuse. MAST asks that work using its data acknowledge the mission and the archive.\",\"status\":\"public-domain\"},\"reductions\":[\"QUALITY: any nonzero flag drops the cadence (1288 dropped)\",\"TIME, PDCSAP_FLUX, PDCSAP_FLUX_ERR: a cadence without a finite value in all three is dropped (0 dropped)\",\"bin: a bin with fewer than 3 kept cadences is dropped (3 dropped)\",\"20-minute bins average 10 two-minute cadences each, which rounds ingress and egress to a bin.\",\"Flux is kept to 1 ppm and its error to 5 ppm.\",\"Normalized by the median. Transit model of the Observatory's fit panel (circular orbit, quadratic limb darkening, 16 quadrature nodes, 5 sub-exposures of 20 minutes), baseline solved exactly; k and b free, epoch, period, a/R*, q1 and q2 fixed.\",\"Uniform prior: k in 0.005 to 0.5, b in 0 to 1 + k. Log-likelihood is minus chi-square over 2 s, s = 7.981 the reduced chi-square at the best point.\",\"Affine-invariant ensemble sampler (stretch move, a = 2), 4 ensembles of 8 walkers, 8000 steps, the first 4000 discarded; seeded.\"],\"retrieved\":\"2026-09-24\"},\"quantities\":[{\"id\":\"k\",\"origin\":\"fitted\",\"uncertainty\":{\"basis\":\"scaled\",\"hi\":0.11939376107266111,\"kind\":\"interval\",\"level\":0.6827,\"lo\":0.11912955136631187},\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":0.11926256515509376},{\"id\":\"b\",\"origin\":\"fitted\",\"uncertainty\":{\"basis\":\"scaled\",\"hi\":0.4326857670809278,\"kind\":\"interval\",\"level\":0.6827,\"lo\":0.4275474572570768},\"unit\":\"\",\"value\"